      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-05-19T18:49:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Does it mean the gpio_pin_get_raw() returns a cached value, like the level previously set? not the actual pin state?",
      "parentUuid": "a51d2500_4c693817",
      "revId": "272f0f0629beb1f46b4d8b7bd2ac10f131779fac",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
